WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
One indigo pulse crosses fine ink infrastructure

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.200
Each plate enters from a distinct edge and locks to a shared spine

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.800
The plates stop; only the shared void expands

4
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.400
Routes merge at existing stations; counts move after the denominator appears

5
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.000
Evidence cartridges slide outward; the camera ends on the wider system
